			<div class="content" id="post-content-2629104">
									

<p>Welp, here is my submission for the D-Class Contest of 2016. I decided that I wanted to go with a more classic Foundation feel with this, one that puts a very human face on the individuals the SCPF throws at Cthulhu on a regular basis. Hope you enjoy it.</p>
<p>Special thanks to djkaktus, Taffeta, A Random Day, TyGently, TwistedGears, Greenwolf, and Minmin for their feedback.</p>
<p>And that's all I have to say about that.</p>

